BLOCK|h1|1|Announcing Cluster-SSG v1.0.0 🚀
BLOCK|p||Today we are proud to announce **Cluster-SSG v1.0.0**, an ultra-fast, zero-dependency static site generator.
BLOCK|h2|2|Key Highlights
BLOCK|list||**Pure Cluster:** 100% written in Cluster language (`.cl`), compiled via LLVM to native machine code.
BLOCK|list||**Native .cld Documents:** High-speed document AST format replacing Markdown and JSON.
BLOCK|list||**Astro Component Islands:** Zero client JavaScript by default with selective partial hydration.
BLOCK|list||**Binary Wire Page Security:** Stream `.clb` binary bytecode directly to browsers to protect source markup and prevent scraping.
BLOCK|code|cluster|// Compiled natively with zero dependencies
fn main() -> int:
